 "remarks": "Experience sophisticated living at 265 Bruce Park Avenue. This stunning new-construction, 3-story end-unit townhome offers approx. 2,600 square feet of thoughtfully designed living space with 5 bedrooms (each w/ own bath), 5 baths, and exceptional high-end finishes throughout. Sun-filled interiors feature a chef's kitchen with Wolf and Sub-Zero appliances, custom cabinetry, and an expansive center island. Flexible spaces accommodate an in-home office, gym, playroom, or additional living area. Enjoy a private garage, driveway parking, and an unbeatable location just moments from Bruce Park, Greenwich Avenue's shopping and dining, Metro-North, and the waterfront. A rare opportunity to enjoy modern luxury and effortless convenience in the heart of Greenwich.",
